NOTICE — provenance of the vendored draft library
=================================================

This file records where part of this codebase came from. It is a statement of fact, not a
grant of rights: this project asserts no licence, and nothing here should be read as one.

The `capcut_draft/` package is not original to this repository. It is a vendored, modified
copy of the open-source library **pyJianYingDraft**, which arrived here by way of the
`sun-guannan/CapCutAPI` project that this codebase descends from. It was carried in-tree
under its original name, `pyJianYingDraft/`, and renamed to `capcut_draft/` on 2026-10-23.
The rename was cosmetic — it changed the directory and import path, nothing about the code's
origin.

The vendored copy has since diverged substantially from what was imported. Changes made here
include translating the source and its documentation from Chinese to English, removing
JianYing-mode support so the library targets CapCut only, deleting the JianYing-only
effect/transition/mask/animation enum catalogs, and adding `Text_shadow` and `TextStyleRange`
support. Defects in the vendored code are therefore as likely to be ours as upstream's.

